5,1,1,talk,May,,I’m tired of the same ideas resurfacing. Let’s check the closure reports before the enthusiasm sets in.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Plans assume crews appear by magic. I need to see which rosters are already empty before we promise anything.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Complaints say it’s crowded, but stopwatches tell a different story. I want to know where the minutes actually go.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Schemes stall for reasons not in the drawings. I need to know who else must say yes and what the ground hides.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Headline totals hide the long-term debt. I want to see the real balances and what we’re committing to pay later.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, if the rosters are empty, the plan is fiction. I’ll look at the pilots from eight years ago.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, agreed. I’ll examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, the ground is a mystery. I’ll check the journey audits and the timed runs mid-city.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, I’ll review the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@All, I’ll look into the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll stick with the two pilots and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll stick with the roster books and the crew establishment. We need to know who is actually there.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I’ll stick with the journey audits and the timed runs. The data will show the real bottleneck.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I’ll stick with the committee minutes and the contingency pricing. We must know the hidden delays.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll stick with the capital ledger and the contractor fees. The numbers must be honest.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Let’s see what the past actually delivered. I’ll review my findings before we vote.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. The data will show if we have the hands to do this. I’ll review my findings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,Agreed. The stopwatch doesn’t lie. I’ll review my findings before we vote.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Agreed. The ground and the committees hold the truth. I’ll review my findings.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. The ledger holds the truth. I’ll review my findings before we vote.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
