35,2,1,talk,May,,"The ferry pilot worked, but the lane-priority stretches were returned to mixed traffic. History repeats itself.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The late-turn pool is thinned. Overtime covers everything. We have no spare capacity for new night work.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,The audits show waiting for connections costs the most time. Queues at machines are under a minute.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The ferry and rail back offices never agreed on data terms. And the pre-war shells hide voids.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The capital ledger is ring-fenced for a lapsed grant. The operating subsidy was trimmed again.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, the data terms are a blocker for any integrated system. The ferry and rail won’t talk.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, exactly. And the crews are a third below establishment. We can’t run new services with this staff.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, if the crews are gone, we can’t fix the connections. But the data says connections are the problem.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, the connections are hard to fix if the ground hides voids. The contingency pricing is scary.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, the contingency is real. But the ticketing fees exceed our paving budget. That’s a structural issue.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"@Jonathan, the ticketing fees are a drain. But the ferry pilot proves the tech works. We just need the data.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, the tech works, but the people don’t. The roster books show we’re running on fumes.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, I hear you. But the journey audits are clear. We need to fix the waiting, not the ticketing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, fixing waiting requires coordination. The committee minutes show they can’t coordinate.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, the coordination is broken. But the capital ledger has a ring-fenced balance. Can we use it?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,"@Jonathan, the ring-fenced balance is for construction. We need to see if it applies to the fare platform.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, if it’s for construction, it doesn’t help the rosters. We need a plan that fits the current staff.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, a plan that fits the staff and fixes the waiting. That’s the only logical path.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, I agree. We must avoid the pre-war shells and the data deadlock.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, I agree. We must choose a plan that respects the ledger and the staffing reality.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
